**/certs/
*.db

# artifacts
*.vsix
**/reports/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/.vscode-test/

# os / editor
.DS_Store

# Claude Code session runtime (keep .claude/skills and settings.json tracked)
.claude/autoharness/

# local-only demo notes
demo-script.md

# Lumina storefront: the scan target, edited during the VS Code demo (apply fix / reset).
